{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c4c40c8773da8813df626028a39034b30035f4a2f07fb51504b0b181a8a8e4ea", "ja": "（今日はアイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影で、育と学校に来た訳だが……）", "zh": "（今天为了偶像写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的拍摄，\n我和育一起来到学校……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "de73eaf9a5761d517d97e7cc3d63ab9608d09d39da33c16e0d017074ca8de5b2", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！\nちがう学校の教室って、なんだか変な感じがするね。", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！\n来到其他学校的教室，感觉有点奇怪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "c73733c076daecc2375f70a565a133391234ab839f4979292abfbef26ad008fb", "ja": "教室のふんいきも、机の数も、\nわたしの学校とぜんぜんちがうし……。", "zh": "教室的气氛、桌子的张数，\n都跟我的学校完全不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "fbe27e640ab7bf5ad14067ef3ff4414b9809b8483ad777f10852738eb49820ba", "ja": "わたし、教室って、どこも一緒なのかと思ってた。", "zh": "我还以为教室都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6e2186780765afc4db52b9886219a1bece13d672535281035184fadac0dae412", "ja": "きっと生徒数や学年によって、変わるんだろうな。\n育は、普段はどの辺の席に座ってるんだ？", "zh": "应该会因学生人数和年级而不同吧，\n育，你平常都坐哪边？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "c652403cec2d5609ccce084fad63518c9521081f00ee5f6adb63d48025424b73", "ja": "えっと、窓ぎわの真ん中だよ！\n校庭がよく見えるんだ♪", "zh": "我想想，是靠窗那排正中间的位子！\n可以清楚看到操场喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a8717d1a94b4673ae8eebe7e69b0e379728a5454503fed205d050cf7a472e46", "ja": "わぁ、外の景色も、やっぱりぜんぜんちがう……。\nちょっとだけ、座っちゃおうかな？　えへへ。", "zh": "哇～外面的风景也完全不同……\n稍微坐一下下好了，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d3743beeb533eb31f0969c4ddde919b02b1976e596f3d91779a1cf5c8eb685b9", "ja": "育、楽しそうだな。\n今の様子を撮影してもらえばよかったかな？", "zh": "你看起来很开心呢。\n看来该请摄影师把你现在的样子拍下来才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a962f68bdeeb33e462eda0c4df49474b0aadc6c20036ca586abe52a537ebce6", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん？\nわたしのこと、あんまり子ども扱いしちゃだめだよ！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生，\n别再把我当小孩子了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "32cdce79ac0668a11c9b84c159f3cb151d46a3deeee2bc436ca98a066ca06a8d", "ja": "ちょっと、はしゃいじゃったけど……。わたし、今日は\nお仕事だってこと、ちゃんとわかってるんだから。", "zh": "虽然刚刚有点兴奋过头……\n但我很清楚今天是来工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3d07bee5a3dd7a39ff51f54f1432848dd3598914ad233a5cab888c7bed3d9f00", "ja": "そうだったな、ごめん。でも今のは、普段の育が\n見られた感じがして、自然でよかったんだよ。", "zh": "对喔，真抱歉，但刚刚感觉看到了育平常的样子，\n很自然、很不错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "6143c2d382bcad0586f13758cd4fa64523b89995e1b2b537ca98a7aacb7e20fd", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ……。\n自然って、うそっぽくないってことだよね。", "zh": "哦，是吗……\n自然是指不会假假的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "1bfde2beba6746921896c3e45804eba96561732bac76ad32e4d9f63a1f46e56e", "ja": "じゃあわたし、今日はいつも学校でしてるみたいに、\nふつうにしてたほうがいいのかな？", "zh": "那我今天是不是该像平常在学校一样，\n保持一般的样子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f113617b89011a2c8894ddefc283a5e8026c25dbd0b1c4eb34dc7459eb255740", "ja": "うん、そうだな。育が普段、\n学校で過ごしてるようにしたらいいと思う。", "zh": "嗯，没错，\n就像你平常在学校里的样子就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "0e7f8582c4e1bd05a9987d508228b8852490a294e127659220dbf4e5bc22cd39", "ja": "えっと、じゃあ最初に、準備をするね。\n1時間目は算数だから、算数の教科書を出して……。", "zh": "嗯，那一开始要先做准备。\n第一堂课是数学，所以要拿出数学课本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6d7de19b6e951357df198c01e98fb20af3054bc3c1c634dfdf73057cd88577fb", "ja": "育は、算数は得意なのか？", "zh": "你擅长数学吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "d44c5ac54a22345e914ca9b02fbbbc5e8d95155d13d6f9125ea88201d621b376", "ja": "ふつうだけど、この前、がんばって100点とったよ。\nおかあさんに、すっごくほめられたんだ！", "zh": "还好，但我之前很努力考了一百分喔，\n妈妈一直夸奖我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e85f025442fd978d7f99d77d396790fd5565f7c4bf5bdfdd2e43b349d558a224", "ja": "100点？　すごいじゃないか！\n育はアイドルだけじゃなく、勉強も頑張ってるんだな。", "zh": "一百分？好厉害喔！\n育不仅努力当偶像，连读书都很努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "ef1a966b5b25ee148ad04fd1acd672b5e375c5937419e1bc6b7c2757d5940ee7", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんだ。アイドルも大事だけど、\n学校の勉強もがんばらないとね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，对呀，虽然当偶像很重要，\n但学校的课业也要加油才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1fa62f1ccc60f5c581c298788cc0462a2a435f939b60ba37a3b64c14823cef38", "ja": "（学校での話題を楽しそうに話す育の笑顔は、\nまさに今回の撮影コンセプトにピッタリだった！）", "zh": "（育在开心谈论学校话题时露出的笑容，\n和这次的拍摄主旨简直一拍即合！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0123_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6440ee88317acd2724c135e195d67481a2e572a216fc042c12e2441bdf1978de", "ja": "（生き生きとした笑顔の育の写真。どれを選ぶべきか、\nきっとギリギリまで迷ってしまうだろう）", "zh": "（育的照片洋溢着生动笑容，\n我肯定会犹豫到最后一刻，不知道该选哪张才好吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
